[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15541.75, "timestamp": "04:19:01", "text": "是啊，你现在嗓子哑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15546.07, "timestamp": "04:19:06", "text": "哦，那肯定是在之前。这样更好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15557.11, "timestamp": "04:19:17", "text": "哎呀，这真的会要了你们的命。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15558.71, "timestamp": "04:19:18", "text": "上帝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15561.99, "timestamp": "04:19:21", "text": "你为什么在睡觉？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15565.83, "timestamp": "04:19:25", "text": "我害怕死亡。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15569.349, "timestamp": "04:19:29", "text": "上帝。你刚才说，你刚才说要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15578.95, "timestamp": "04:19:38", "text": "哇。所以，你醒来后就会这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15580.71, "timestamp": "04:19:40", "text": "你起来，相信我，然后你又回去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15582.99, "timestamp": "04:19:42", "text": "睡觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15586.309, "timestamp": "04:19:46", "text": "好的。而那个洞穴实际上是伊莱克特拉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15589.03, "timestamp": "04:19:49", "text": "与洞穴的搭配看起来真的很好看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15592.309, "timestamp": "04:19:52", "text": "这是原生的 Vanilla 功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15595.189, "timestamp": "04:19:55", "text": "呃，那是什么披风？是的。是的。是的。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15599.03, "timestamp": "04:19:59", "text": "是本地人。这是原生语言。哇。乔，"}]